---
layout: profile
---
{%- comment -%}
  The blog index as their profile page: the highlighted post as their top post, then every post in
  their list under the category tabs, with the sidebar's topics and years.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign featured = site.posts | where: 'highlight', true | first -%}
{%- if featured %}
{% include lw/top_post.liquid post=featured label='Featured' %}
{%- endif %}
<section class="ProfilePageUnshared-allPostsSection">
  <div class="ProfilePageTabbedSectionUnshared-allPostsLeftColumn">
    {% include lw/post_tabs.liquid count=site.posts.size %}
    {% include lw/post_rows.liquid posts=site.posts page_size=10 %}
  </div>
  {% include lw/sidebar.liquid topics=true %}
</section>
